, "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "seed": 341, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "蓝色部分原样保留，工具调用与结果保持配对；分层是管理分工，不是消息角色或权限排序。", "originalText": "蓝色部分原样保留，工具调用与结果保持配对；分层是管理分工，不是消息角色或权限排序。", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}